<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>فاتورة شراء جديدة | Al Captain</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.rtl.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        body {
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(11, 11, 26, 0.9), rgba(11, 11, 26, 0.9)),
            url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552519507-da3b142c6e3d?q=80&w=2070&auto=format&fit=crop');
            background-size: cover; background-attachment: fixed;
            color: #fdfdfd; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
        }
        .glass-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 30px;
        }
        .form-label { color: #0dcaf0; font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.9rem; }
        .form-control, .form-select {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) !important;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            color: #fff !important;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }
        .form-control:focus {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15) !important;
            border-color: #0dcaf0;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(13, 202, 240, 0.3);
        }
        .btn-purchase {
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, #0dcaf0, #007bff);
            border: none; color: white; font-weight: bold;
            padding: 12px; border-radius: 12px; transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .btn-purchase:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(13, 202, 240, 0.4); }
        .section-title { border-right: 4px solid #0dcaf0; padding-right: 15px; margin-bottom: 25px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container-fluid py-2 no-print" style="background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);">
        <div class="container d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
                <span>مرحباً، <strong class="text-info"><%= user.name %></strong></span>
                <a href="/logout" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger">خروج</a>
            </div>
            <a href="/" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-light rounded-pill px-3">الرئيسية</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container py-5">
        <div class="glass-card shadow-lg">
            <div class="section-title">
                <h2 class="fw-bold mb-0">إنشاء فاتورة شراء سيارة</h2>
                <small class="text-white-50">تسجيل بيانات التكلفة والمواصفات لإضافتها للجرد</small>
            </div>

            <form action="/finance/add-purchase-invoice" method="POST">
                <div class="row g-4">
                    <div class="col-md-3">
                        <label class="form-label">البراند (Brand)</label>
                        <input type="text" name="brand" class="form-control" placeholder="مثلاً: BMW" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-3">
                        <label class="form-label">الموديل (Model)</label>
                        <input type="text" name="model" class="form-control" placeholder="مثلاً: X5" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-3">
                        <label class="form-label">سنة الصنع</label>
                        <input type="number" name="year" class="form-control" placeholder="2024" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-3">
                        <label class="form-label">اللون</label>
                        <input type="text" name="color" class="form-control" placeholder="أسود ملكي">
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        <label class="form-label">رقم الشاسيه (Chassis)</label>
                        <input type="text" name="chassis" class="form-control" style="text-transform: uppercase;" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        <label class="form-label">قوة المحرك (CC)</label>
                        <input type="number" name="engine" class="form-control" placeholder="2000">
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        <label class="form-label">العداد (Mileage KM)</label>
                        <input type="number" name="mileage" class="form-control" value="0">
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <label class="form-label">سعر الشراء (التكلفة)</label>
                        <div class="input-group">
                            <input type="number" step="0.01" name="buyPrice" class="form-control" placeholder="0.00" required>
                            <select name="currency" class="form-select" style="max-width: 120px;">
                                <option value="USD">دولار ($)</option>
                                <option value="EUR">يورو (€)</option>
                                <option value="EGP">جنيه مصري</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>
                        <small class="text-white-50 mt-1 d-block">هذا السعر لن يظهر للعملاء، سيستخدم لحساب الأرباح فقط.</small>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <label class="form-label">ملاحظات إضافية</label>
                        <input type="text" name="notes" class="form-control" placeholder="حالة العربية، كماليات، إلخ">
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-12 mt-5">
                        <hr class="opacity-10">
                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-purchase w-100 fs-5">
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle me-2"></i> حفظ الفاتورة وإرسالها للجرد
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>